{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MagiClean is a relaxing magical incremental clicker game. Step into the shoes of a young magician tasked with restoring a Wizarding School to its former glory. Brew potions and merge them to become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948440/extras/b0b295d3192ed7dc1c89ace899de6d55.poster.avif?t=1773479542\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948440/extras/b0b295d3192ed7dc1c89ace899de6d55.webm?t=1773479542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948440/extras/b0b295d3192ed7dc1c89ace899de6d55.mp4?t=1773479542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade 15+ unique tools and abilities to tackle different magical cleaning challenges for an ultimate magical cleaning power fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948440/extras/c4ba9cde7881bc1b164fb0a156dd9829.poster.avif?t=1773479542\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948440/extras/c4ba9cde7881bc1b164fb0a156dd9829.webm?t=1773479542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948440/extras/c4ba9cde7881bc1b164fb0a156dd9829.mp4?t=1773479542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the power of Fire, Wind, Light and Water to clean up different types of magical messes, and bring warmth back to a forgotten castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948440/extras/5181a98efbf057d408fc2e2ca9bbfd30.poster.avif?t=1773479542\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948440/extras/5181a98efbf057d408fc2e2ca9bbfd30.webm?t=1773479542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948440/extras/5181a98efbf057d408fc2e2ca9bbfd30.mp4?t=1773479542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing and satisfying clicker gameplay - perfect for fans of magical adventures, cozy games, and idle clicker mechanics. Can you bring the magic back to its rightful place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948440/extras/af5c6beb223cc41bbea3c8622a008691.poster.avif?t=1773479542\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948440/extras/af5c6beb223cc41bbea3c8622a008691.webm?t=1773479542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948440/extras/af5c6beb223cc41bbea3c8622a008691.mp4?t=1773479542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948440?t=1773479542","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948440/5ffa2813b17afc62215d3e490f00c8cbced28b13/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773479542","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948440/349939e2d0a89e9f1a4390f63203946e281dbfda/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773479542","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948440/349939e2d0a89e9f1a4390f63203946e281dbfda